      "id": "R005",
      "decision": "d-pending-owner-741-unused-helper-attribute-20261124",
      "change": "The projection kernel's rmc_dalloc_raw, a static inline helper a model may not call, carries RMC_UNUSED (__attribute__((unused)) under GCC and Clang), defined beside RMC_COLD in both guards, so Clang's -Wunused-function accepts a model that emits no caller. Printing only; no rendered decision changes.",
